    [Doc] Provide A2 PP2 TP16 deployment script (#19667)
    
    ## Summary
    
    - Document the eight-node A2 MemCache KV cache pool topology.
    - Configure one Prefill instance across P0-P3 with DP1, PP2, and TP16.
    - Configure one Decode group across D0-D3 with DP16 and TP2.
    - Update launch scripts, Mooncake/MemCache connector settings, and proxy
    configuration.
    - Remove stale two-instance and twelve-node deployment descriptions.
    
    ## Validation
    
    - `git diff --check`
    - Documentation-only change; no source code or test files were modified.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
